## Registration Date & Owner Creation — Findings

### 1. How dates are represented
`registrationDate` is a **`java.time.LocalDate`**, mapped to DB column `registration_date`.
- Entity field: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java` (lines 54-55), with getter/setter at 101-107.
